  "source_shape_findings": [
    "Complete four-storey nine-bay long body with both occupied projecting end classrooms and real open circulation gallery/backing. No hidden interior rooms modeled; no invented empty court floor.",
    "R diagram has six bays at about the same89px spacing as4F nine bays. Shared stair/main rear-column line registration is(-38,-73)px, not global scaling. Full4F occupied footprint remains roofed, with only a bounded roof access core. Partial R coverage and exact roof access height remain uncertain.",
    "Reviewer earlier illustrative y-89 estimate is explicitly withdrawn: it mismatched the4F protruding cap y28 with the R column/stair line. Accepted y-73 aligns homologous column lines and stair treads within schematic precision; both first report and correction remain historical evidence.",
    "518 central broad stair, adjacent continuous turning/fan stair, east external steps and north short steps remain distinct from519 attached2F landing. West core gets its own bounded ground contact, not court infill. Full independent bridge span toYixian is excluded at the agreed attachment scope; no false transverse closure wall.",
    "514 entry is an opaque dark stone/signage back panel with unlettered neutral plaque, not an ordinary glazed window or fabricated through-door. The attached stair/landing is an exterior low-detail interpretation, not a reconstruction of interior door circulation.",
    "515 local vertical screen and upper brown band/narrow windows plus516 end-wing window/white pier language reproduced as bounded opaque relief. Unknown rear windows are not mirrored. Fine window counts/heights, absolute dimensions and grade remain approximate.",
    "Seven true per-face material groups retained from Boolean surface provenance, not nearest-face repainting. Native mesh,STL and3MF exact coordinates/order/winding; no source photograph/plan/PDF/overlay or texture pixels embedded."
  ],
